      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BANDIT CHLOE (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish a neck away in second (20.11) behind Nana Marie at this track. Makes plenty of appeal. ALSTON (6) looks close to win after hitting the frame last run (25.73) at Temora in a Grade 4/5. Has first look at box 6 this time. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expecting another good run. DRINK MICKEYS (8) finds it hard to break through. Finished third (19.86) at this track last time making it three minors on end. Form at the trip sound including nine wins. Winning chance. SIMULATE (2) can sneak into the finish while fresh.",
